, "impression_count": 124, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "It would make sense if frontier AI labs were secretly delivering more advanced models to the government.\n\nIt would also make absolutely no sense if they weren't.", "url": "https://x.com/NateLorenzen/status/2118816113706635438"}, {"author_id": "2070622830522519552", "created_at": "2026-11-06T21:30:00.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118818206886351048"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/MCiOCZ5iZL", "end": 187, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/MarliseKarlin/status/2118818206886351048/video/1", "media_key": "13_2118436574228885504", "start": 164, "url": "https://t.co/MCiOCZ5iZL"}]}, "id": "2118818206886351048", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 1, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Can a frontier AI model become coherent and trustworthy in 48 hours — the data says yes. The open question is now how do we sustain that environment through scale. https://t.co/MCiOCZ5iZL", "url": "https://x.com/MarliseKarlin/status/2118818206886351048"}, {"author_id": "1859780116014141440", "created_at": "2026-11-06T22:00:15.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118825816733680048"], "entities": {"urls": [{"description": "Rapid7’s summary of a Gartner report says frontier AI could turn weaknesses into usable attack paths faster, urging teams to prioritize reachable exposures…", "display_url": "cyber.hendryadrian.com/article/16631/…", "end": 258, "expanded_url": "https://cyber.hendryadrian.com/article/16631/rapid7-highlights-gartner-s-call-to-prioritize-attack-paths-as-ai-advances-vulnerability-discovery", "images": [{"height": 630, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2118825821485830144/H4LHLnwi?format=png&name=orig", "width": 1200}, {"height": 150, "url": "https://pbs.twimg.com/news_img/2118825821485830144/H4LHLnwi?format=png&name=150x150", "width": 150}], "start": 235, "status": 200, "title": "Rapid7 Highlights Gartner’s Call to Prioritize Attack Paths as AI Advances Vulnerability Discovery", "unwound_url": "https://cyber.hendryadrian.com/article/16631/rapid7-highlights-gartner-s-call-to-prioritize-attack-paths-as-ai-advances-vulnerability-discovery", "url": "https://t.co/H8w3ZLXI4n"}]}, "id": "2118825816733680048", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 35, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Rapid7’s summary of a Gartner report says frontier AI could turn weaknesses into usable attack paths faster, urging teams to prioritize reachable exposures, response outcomes, attack-path analysis, patching, and compensating controls.\nhttps://t.co/H8w3ZLXI4n", "url": "https://x.com/TweetThreatNews/status/2118825816733680048"}, {"author_id": "2107501653255438336", "created_at": "2026-11-06T21:52:49.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118823947386892736"], "entities": {"mentions": [{"end": 11, "id": "2003545868612644864", "start": 0, "username": "BlockRunAI"}], "urls": [{"display_url": "x.com/BaseInsider_/s…", "end": 278, "expanded_url": "https://twitter.com/BaseInsider_/status/2118818208090087833", "start": 255, "url": "https://t.co/uXwUefz4tI"}]}, "id": "2118823947386892736", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 8, "like_count": 1, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 1, "retweet_count": 1}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2118818208090087833", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "@BlockRunAI Agent Money Benchmark found that 7 out of 10 frontier AI models got scammed at least once when handling real money.\n\nI'd love to see this benchmark run again with Vantarix integrated.\n\nSame agents. Same tasks. Same adversarial scenarios.....👇 https://t.co/uXwUefz4tI", "url": "https://x.com/VantarixHQ/status/2118823947386892736"}, {"author_id": "3341874665", "created_at": "2026-11-06T21:17:35.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118815080620130467"], "id": "2118815080620130467", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 730, "like_count": 16, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 3, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Nearly 10 years in crypto, 4 years using frontier AI...  \n\nAnd there isn't a day that goes by lately that I don't actively think about becoming a luddite.  \n\nNot sure what that says, but I can't be the only one.", "url": "https://x.com/seanlippel/status/2118815080620130467"}, {"author_id": "1777756835409186816", "created_at": "2026-11-06T22:00:43.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118825933503082497"], "entities": {"cashtags": [{"end": 265, "start": 260, "tag": "NDAQ"}], "hashtags": [{"end": 274, "start": 266, "tag": "Finance"}], "urls": [{"display_url": "pic.x.com/4NWqu6coCE", "end": 298, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/plocamium/status/2118825933503082497/photo/1", "media_key": "3_2118825932106366976", "start": 275, "url": "https://t.co/4NWqu6coCE"}]}, "id": "2118825933503082497", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 1, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "Anthropic's S-1 targets a $1.5-2 trillion Nasdaq debut valuation, claiming $70 billion annualized recurring revenue. The filing forces a reckoning: frontier AI labs now command $120 billion combined ARR, yet the top 1 percent of customers drive most spending.\n$NDAQ #Finance https://t.co/4NWqu6coCE", "url": "https://x.com/plocamium/status/2118825933503082497"}, {"author_id": "1616559284426539010", "created_at": "2026-11-06T20:55:56.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118809631594332494"], "id": "2118809631594332494", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 20, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "ChatGPT and Claude are both utter dogshit today. I guess this is what the next decade of frontier AI is going to look like under democrat rule. They have to start preparing to color inside the arbitrary lines and look for ways to pay off Dem politicians and their patronage groups", "url": "https://x.com/imtweetn/status/2118809631594332494"}, {"author_id": "1645870939056349185", "created_at": "2026-11-06T20:56:57.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118809886238842921"], "id": "2118809886238842921", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 0, "impression_count": 14, "like_count": 0, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 0, "retweet_count": 0}, "text": "A leader at an old job once told me that writing things down was the antithesis of the AI revolution.\n\nI disagreed. Today I work at a frontier AI lab, and I disagree even more.\n\nWriting is thinking.\n\nWhat has AI changed about how you work, and what do you refuse to give up?", "url": "https://x.com/omkhar/status/2118809886238842921"}, {"author_id": "1438592405201096705", "created_at": "2026-11-06T21:17:29.000Z", "edit_history_tweet_ids": ["2118815055357911079"], "entities": {"urls": [{"display_url": "integrate.api.nvidia.com/v1", "end": 212, "expanded_url": "https://integrate.api.nvidia.com/v1", "start": 189, "status": 404, "unwound_url": "https://integrate.api.nvidia.com/v1", "url": "https://t.co/QwI9WrA25Q"}, {"display_url": "pic.x.com/kYTncTTnqU", "end": 305, "expanded_url": "https://x.com/zefirium/status/2118815055357911079/video/1", "media_key": "13_2118814922616315904", "start": 282, "url": "https://t.co/kYTncTTnqU"}, {"display_url": "x.com/zefirium/statu…", "end": 329, "expanded_url": "https://twitter.com/zefirium/status/2077025191561961519", "start": 306, "url": "https://t.co/fv7oIGC38g"}]}, "id": "2118815055357911079", "public_metrics": {"bookmark_count": 10, "impression_count": 411, "like_count": 14, "quote_count": 0, "reply_count": 3, "retweet_count": 1}, "referenced_tweets": [{"id": "2077025191561961519", "type": "quoted"}], "text": "nvidia is hosting frontier AI MODELS FOR FREE\n\nno card for the trial key:\n\n&gt; nvidia nim: deepseek v4.1 flash, glm 5.3 flash, mistral large 4, step 5 preview. openai-compatible base url: https://t.co/QwI9WrA25Q\n\n&gt; op